  "releaseNotes": "# Changes since version 9.1.3:\n\n## Fixed\n- Fixed an issue where `GcPdfDocument.RemoveDuplicateImages()` could incorrectly deduplicate distinct image XObjects, resulting in incorrect image substitution in the generated PDF. (DOC-7782)\n- Corrected a packaging issue affecting the digital signatures of the included assemblies. (DOC-7807)",
